Start with [Building applications]($link.page("docs/building-apps")) to choose a frontend-only or ZigBase-paired workflow. Read the [feature backlog]($link.page("docs/roadmap")) for planned work.

Start with the [overview]($link.page("docs/overview")) for what Zigapagos is and how a
build runs. If you would rather have something on screen first, the
[quick start]($link.page("docs/quick-start")) gets a site building in about five minutes,
and the [tutorial]($link.page("docs/tutorial")) builds a real one with islands in it.
